{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109788","id":2757826104,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6kYRY4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109788","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109788.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109788","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109788/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109788/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109788/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7eb46829ce9d58ff3542cb0843e10cff8c6267f8","number":109788,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Revert \"MP3: Remove unnecessary memory allocation\"","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This reverts https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95999 that caused GCC One Definition Rule (ODR) warnings across translation units when using LTO.\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n```c++\r\n// Changed:\r\nmp3dec_ex_t *mp3d = memnew(mp3dec_ex_t);\r\n\r\n// To:\r\nmp3dec_ex_t *mp3d = (mp3dec_ex_t *)memalloc(sizeof(mp3dec_ex_t));\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Previous Warnings**:\r\n```c++\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:88:3: warning: type 'struct mp3dec_ex_t' violates the C++ One Definition Rule [-Wodr]\r\n   88 | } mp3dec_ex_t;\r\n      |   ^\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:88:3: note: a different type is defined in another translation unit\r\n   88 | } mp3dec_ex_t;\r\n      |   ^\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:82:19: note: the first difference of corresponding definitions is field 'buffer'\r\n   82 |     mp3d_sample_t buffer[MINIMP3_MAX_SAMPLES_PER_FRAME];\r\n      |                   ^\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:82:19: note: a field of same name but different type is defined in another translation unit\r\n   82 |     mp3d_sample_t buffer[MINIMP3_MAX_SAMPLES_PER_FRAME];\r\n      |                   ^\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:88:3: note: type 'mp3d_sample_t' should match type 'mp3d_sample_t'\r\n   88 | } mp3dec_ex_t;\r\n      |   ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:38:7: warning: type 'struct AudioStreamPlaybackMP3' violates the C++ One Definition Rule [-Wodr]\r\n   38 | class AudioStreamPlaybackMP3 : public AudioStreamPlaybackResampled {\r\n      |       ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:38:7: note: a different type is defined in another translation unit\r\n   38 | class AudioStreamPlaybackMP3 : public AudioStreamPlaybackResampled {\r\n      |       ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:49:21: note: the first difference of corresponding definitions is field 'mp3d'\r\n   49 |         mp3dec_ex_t mp3d{};\r\n      |                     ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:49:21: note: a field of same name but different type is defined in another translation unit\r\n   49 |         mp3dec_ex_t mp3d{};\r\n      |                     ^\r\n./thirdparty/minimp3/minimp3_ex.h:88:3: note: type 'struct mp3dec_ex_t' itself violates the C++ One Definition Rule\r\n   88 | } mp3dec_ex_t;\r\n      |   ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:39:9: warning: type of 'is_class_ptr' does not match original declaration [-Wlto-type-mismatch]\r\n   39 |         GDCLASS(AudioStreamPlaybackMP3, AudioStreamPlaybackResampled);\r\n      |         ^\r\nmodules/minimp3/audio_stream_mp3.h:39:9: note: 'is_class_ptr' was previously declared here\r\n   39 |         GDCLASS(AudioStreamPlaybackMP3, AudioStreamPlaybackResampled);\r\n      |         ^\r\n```\r\n\r\n<s>Another option is to silence the warnings (Never used elsewhere in the source code):</s>\r\nEdit: It didn't work, the warnings are thrown durning link time.\r\n```c++\r\n#pragma GCC diagnostic push\r\n#pragma GCC diagnostic ignored \"-Wodr\"\r\n\tmp3dec_ex_t mp3d = {};\r\n#pragma GCC diagnostic pop\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-19T22:41:46Z","u